The file patches the real Go source of encoding/json/v2_encode.go.

Marshal reads the fast walk of the runtime library first. The Go code walks the
value with the arshalers of encoding/json/v2, and each field of a struct
reaches reflect.Value.Field. A measure of 2026-09-09 gave 43 percent of the
cost of a marshal to that 1 call.

The walk of the runtime holds each rule of the v1 options, and it gives no
bytes for a value that it cannot prove. Each such value reaches the code of
encoding/json/v2 below, thus every byte and every error keeps the answer of Go.

